{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15728","headline":"过卢秦卿旧居 · 司空曙","name":"过卢秦卿旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五柳茅茨楚国贤，桔槔蔬圃水涓涓。\n黄花寒後难逢蝶，红叶晴来忽有蝉。\n韩康助采君臣药，支遁同看内外篇。\n爲问潜夫空着论，如何侍从赋甘泉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15728.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15728","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}